## Executive Summary

The Zakaa-io website is a Next.js 15 + React 19 application with a custom backend layer consisting of route handlers, in-memory state, PostgreSQL persistence, session-based auth, and AI integration. The codebase demonstrates solid Phase 1-4 feature delivery (AI chat, lead scoring, assessment wizard, demo simulator, portal triage, observability) but carries significant technical debt in state management, security hardening, testing, and operational readiness. This roadmap prioritizes fixes that reduce risk, improve reliability, and enable scale.

